{"id":"e9e5b938a5d6b2ad","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-thm-marczewski-trees.md","title":"Marczewski Trees","display":"thm-marczewski-trees — Marczewski Trees","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-marczewski-trees","aliases":["58-thm-marczewski-trees"],"display":"thm-marczewski-trees — Marczewski Trees","depends_on":["[[58-df-tree]]","[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-marczewski-trees"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-marczewski-trees</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-marczewski-trees — Marczewski Trees"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c5203cd487b6ba6d\" href=\"?note=c5203cd487b6ba6d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-domain.md\">../batch09/58-df-domain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,T,S,P,Q\\in V\">\\(A,T,S,P,Q\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,S,P,Q\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T,S,P,Q\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\sqsubseteq t\">\\(s\\sqsubseteq t\\)</span> means that the finite sequence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> is an initial segment of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq_T\\coloneqq\\sqsubseteq\\cap T^2\">\\(\\sqsubseteq_T\\coloneqq\\sqsubseteq\\cap T^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}\\)</span> is the imported order-explicit tree predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Br}\">\\(\\operatorname{Br}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MarczewskiNull}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MarczewskiNull}_S\\)</span> are the local typed notions defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baire\\text{-}tree\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baire\\text{-}tree\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}branch\\text{-}set\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Br}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}branch\\text{-}set\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Br}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}tree\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S(S)\\land S\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in S\\;\\exists t_0,t_1\\in S\\;\\bigl(\ns\\sqsubseteq t_0\\land s\\sqsubseteq t_1\n\\land t_0\\not\\sqsubseteq t_1\\land t_1\\not\\sqsubseteq t_0\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}subtree\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nS\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}tree\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S(S)\\land S\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in S\\;\\exists t_0,t_1\\in S\\;\\bigl(\ns\\sqsubseteq t_0\\land s\\sqsubseteq t_1\n\\land t_0\\not\\sqsubseteq t_1\\land t_1\\not\\sqsubseteq t_0\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}subtree\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nS\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}null}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MarczewskiNull}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(P)\\to\n\\exists Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S(Q,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{Br}(Q)\\cap A=\\varnothing\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}null}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MarczewskiNull}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(P)\\to\n\\exists Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S(Q,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{Br}(Q)\\cap A=\\varnothing\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}trees}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S(T)\n\\to\\left(\n\\mathrm{MarczewskiNull}_S(\\operatorname{Br}(T))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists S\\in V\\;\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}trees}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S(T)\n\\to\\left(\n\\mathrm{MarczewskiNull}_S(\\operatorname{Br}(T))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists S\\in V\\;\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ideal applies to the closed branch set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Br}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Br}(T)\\)</span>, not to the tree code.  For closed subsets of Baire space, Marczewski nullity is equivalent to containing no perfect subset.</li>\n<li>The imported <code>df-perfect</code> defines metric-space perfect subsets and does not define perfect trees.  Perfect trees and perfect subtrees are therefore given explicitly here.</li>\n<li>This relates to the perfect set property.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5203cd487b6ba6d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,T,S,P,Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T,S,P,Q\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\sqsubseteq t","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq_T\\coloneqq\\sqsubseteq\\cap T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Br}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MarczewskiNull}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baire\\text{-}tree\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}\n\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}branch\\text{-}set\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Br}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}tree\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S(S)\\land S\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall s\\in S\\;\\exists t_0,t_1\\in S\\;\\bigl(\ns\\sqsubseteq t_0\\land s\\sqsubseteq t_1\n\\land t_0\\not\\sqsubseteq t_1\\land t_1\\not\\sqsubseteq t_0\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}subtree\\text{-}for\\text{-}marczewski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nS\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}null}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MarczewskiNull}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nA\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(P)\\to\n\\exists Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S(Q,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{Br}(Q)\\cap A=\\varnothing\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}trees}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BaireTree}_S(T)\n\\to\\left(\n\\mathrm{MarczewskiNull}_S(\\operatorname{Br}(T))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists S\\in V\\;\\mathrm{PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Br}(T)","display":false}],"bytes":2704,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4295","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-thm-marczewski-trees.md|58-thm-marczewski-trees]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["f06e57c5c0b1354d","c5203cd487b6ba6d"]}